From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:52:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 33/34] freedreno/xenos: don't shadow buffers

Xenos has no GPU buffer copy, so shadowing a busy buffer copied the rest of
it on the CPU, reading back through the write-combined mapping. glmark2's
glBufferSubData scene ran at 24 fps; waiting for the GPU instead, 70.

